== self-test.  Every decision function must fire on a known-positive. ==
  B-1 a monotone series reads TIME                 fires
  B-2 a sawtooth reads WORK                        fires
  B-3 noise wider than the effect is UNRESOLVABLE  fires
  B-4 a recovery of exactly the spread does not tip fires
  B-5 a rise at the end is NEITHER, not TIME       fires
  B-6 a flat series is UNRESOLVABLE, not TIME      fires
  C-1 a planted slope is recovered                 fires
  C-2 and it is scored as fully explained          fires
  C-3 a predictor noisier than its target is REFUSED fires
  C-4 too few cells is NOT COMPUTABLE              fires
  C-5 partial explanation reports a fraction below 1 fires

  11 of 11 fire.

